## ---------------------------------------------------------
## NCCR DATMM — Shared Concept Instances
## ---------------------------------------------------------
## Subject concepts referenced by Dataset records via
## dct:subject. Each concept follows the NLM pattern:
##   - a skos:Concept
##   - dct:source "repository_supplied"
##   - rdfs:label (human-readable term)
##   - skos:inScheme "MeSH RDF"
##   - dct:identifier (authoritative MeSH descriptor URI)
##
## All MeSH descriptor IDs verified against the NLM MeSH
## browser (meshb.nlm.nih.gov / id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh).
## ---------------------------------------------------------

@prefix datmm:  <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/datmm/> .
@prefix dct:    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdfs:   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos:   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

## === Shared subjects (applied to all datasets) ===

<http://id.nlm.nih.gov/datmm/concept/nccr-0001> a skos:Concept ;
    dct:source "repository_supplied" ;
    rdfs:label "Pediatrics" ;
    skos:inScheme "MeSH RDF" ;
    dct:identifier <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D010372> .

<http://id.nlm.nih.gov/datmm/concept/nccr-0002> a skos:Concept ;
    dct:source "repository_supplied" ;
    rdfs:label "Neoplasms" ;
    skos:inScheme "MeSH RDF" ;
    dct:identifier <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D009369> .

